    <string name="content_license_agreement">IPTV tana goyan bayan jerin waƙoƙin M3U da JSON waɗanda masu amfani suka ƙirƙira. Ba mu samarwa ko daukar nauyin kowane abun ciki.\n\nWannan app an yi shi ne don abun ciki da aka samu bisa doka kawai. Kai ne ke da alhakin tabbatar da lissafin waƙa da abun ciki suna bin dokoki da izini masu dacewa.\n\nTa ci gaba, kuna tabbatar da cewa kun fahimci kuma kun karɓi waɗannan sharuɗɗan. An hana yawo mara izini na kayan haƙƙin mallaka.</string>
    <string name="content_1">Kuna iya bincika kan layi tare da kalmomi kamar "Jin waƙa na IPTV M3U" ko duba jagorar da sabis ɗin TV ɗinku/streaming ke bayarwa.\nMadaidaicin hanyar haɗin M3U yawanci:\n• Yana farawa da http:// ko https://\n• Ya ƙare da .m3u ko .m3u8\nKokarin amfani da amintattun hanyoyin doka a duk lokacin da zai yiwu. Lura cewa wasu lissafin waƙa na iya ƙarewa, suna buƙatar takaddun shaidar shiga, ko iyakance ta yanki.</string>
    <string name="content_2">Don kwafe M3U URL:\n• A wayar hannu: Taɓa ka riƙe hanyar haɗin → zaɓi Kwafi hanyar haɗin yanar gizo \n• A kan tebur: Danna maɓallin dama → zaɓi Kwafi adireshin haɗin yanar gizo\nDon zazzage fayil ɗin lissafin waƙa:\n• Ajiye fayil ɗin .m3u ko .m3u8 zuwa wuri mai sauƙi-da-hankali akan na\'urarku\nZaku iya shigo da fayil ɗin kai tsaye daga mataki na gida.</string>
    <string name="content_3">Kaddamar da IPTV Smart Player.\n Zaɓi Ƙara Lissafin Waƙa.\n Zaɓi hanya ɗaya don shigo da:\n• Ta URL → Manna hanyar haɗin M3U ɗinku\n• Daga Fayil → Bincike kuma zaɓi fayil ɗin .m3u / .m3u8 da aka ajiye akan na\'urarku\n(Na zaɓi) Shigar da sunan al\'ada don gane lissafin waƙa daga baya\nTaɓa Ajiye don gamawa.</string>
    <string name="content_4">Ba wa app ɗin ɗan lokaci don loda tashoshi da rukunoni.\nBincika jerin tashoshi ko amfani da fasalin Bincike don gano abin da kuke so da sauri.\nIdan babu wani abun ciki da ya bayyana:\n• Duba haɗin Intanet ɗinku\n• Tabbatar cewa haɗin M3U ko fayil yana aiki kuma yana aiki.</string>
    <string name="an_internet_connection_is_required_to_continue_using_the_app_please_check_your_network_settings_and_reconnect">Ana buƙatar haɗin intanet don ci gaba da amfani da app.\n Da fatan za a duba saitunan cibiyar sadarwar ku kuma sake haɗawa.</string>
